  era: "c. 2nd c. CE \xB7 Section 9 \xB7 Sangam Age \xB7 c. 3rd century BCE \u2013 3rd century CE"
  title: The early Cholas
  text: The early Cholas ruled the Kaveri delta from Uraiyur and the port of Puhar, also called Kaveripattinam. Karikala Chola is remembered for his victories and for building an embankment on the Kaveri, linked by tradition to the Kallanai dam.
